./data/docling_include_no_vlm_2026-07-09/chunks/full_2026_07_06_rec_001358.jsonl:120:{"candidate_id": "full_2026-07-06__rec_001358", "chunk_index": 120, "text": "Supplementary  Figure  22:  Comparison  of  three  selected  cell  embeddings  from  native, finetuned scGPT, and scPEFT on the lung cancer atlas.  a, Top: UMAP of all cells highlighting the  T  cell  population.  Bottom:  zoomed-in  UMAPs  of  T  cell  embeddings  from  native  scGPT,\nfinetuned scGPT, and scPEFT, respectively, colored by their fine-grained cell type annotations. b, Bar  plots  showing  CHI  scores  of  T  cell  embeddings  across  fine  categories  from  the  three models. c, UMAP visualizations of macrophage/monocyte cell embeddings from native scGPT, finetuned  scGPT,  and  scPEFT,  respectively,  colored  by  their  fine  annotations. d, Bar  plots showing CHI scores of macrophage/monocyte cell embeddings across fine categories. e, UMAP visualizations of cDC embeddings from each model, colored by their fine annotations. f, Bar plots showing CHI scores of cDC cell embeddings across fine categories.", "contextualized_text": "Harnessing the power of single-cell large language models with parameter-efficient fine-tuning using scPEFT\nSupplementary Figures\nSupplementary  Figure  22:  Comparison  of  three  selected  cell  embeddings  from  native, finetuned scGPT, and scPEFT on the lung cancer atlas.  a, Top: UMAP of all cells highlighting the  T  cell  population.  Bottom:  zoomed-in  UMAPs  of  T  cell  embeddings  from  native  scGPT,\nfinetuned scGPT, and scPEFT, respectively, colored by their fine-grained cell type annotations. b, Bar  plots  showing  CHI  scores  of  T  cell  embeddings  across  fine  categories  from  the  three models. c, UMAP visualizations of macrophage/monocyte cell embeddings from native scGPT, finetuned  scGPT,  and  scPEFT,  respectively,  colored  by  their  fine  annotations. d, Bar  plots showing CHI scores of macrophage/monocyte cell embeddings across fine categories. e, UMAP visualizations of cDC embeddings from each model, colored by their fine annotations. f, Bar plots showing CHI scores of cDC cell embeddings across fine categories.", "headings": ["Harnessing the power of single-cell large language models with parameter-efficient fine-tuning using scPEFT", "Supplementary Figures"], "pages": [52, 53], "meta": {"schema_name": "docling_core.transforms.chunker.DocMeta", "version": "1.0.0", "doc_items": [{"self_ref": "#/texts/231", "parent": {"cref": "#/pictures/21"}, "children": [], "content_layer": "body", "meta": null, "label": "caption", "prov": [{"page_no": 52, "bbox": {"l": 72.0, "t": 124.54463999999996, "r": 543.1699199999999, "b": 85.74830532596684, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "charspan": [0, 286]}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/233", "parent": {"cref": "#/body"}, "children": [], "content_layer": "body", "meta": null, "label": "text", "prov": [{"page_no": 53, "bbox": {"l": 72.0, "t": 717.5846399999999, "r": 543.3188639999997, "b": 620.4683053259668, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "charspan": [0, 644]}]}], "headings": ["Harnessing the power of single-cell large language models with parameter-efficient fine-tuning using scPEFT", "Supplementary Figures"], "captions": null, "origin": {"mimetype": "application/pdf", "binary_hash": 3578786038470275027, "filename": "full_text_02_landing_pdf_link.pdf", "uri": null}}}
./data/docling_include_no_vlm_2026-07-09/chunks/full_2026_07_06_rec_001358.jsonl:121:{"candidate_id": "full_2026-07-06__rec_001358", "chunk_index": 121, "text": "Supplementary  Figure  23:  Comparison  of  two  selected  cell  embeddings  from  native, finetuned scGPT, and scPEFT on the lung cancer atlas. a, Top: UMAP of all cells highlighting the Endothelial cell population. Bottom: zoomed-in UMAPs of Endothelial cell embeddings from native scGPT, finetuned scGPT, and scPEFT, respectively, colored by their fine-grained cell type annotations. b, Bar  plots  showing  CHI  scores  of  Endothelial  cell  embeddings  across  fine categories from the three models. c, UMAP visualizations of Stromal cell embeddings from native scGPT, finetuned scGPT, and scPEFT, respectively, colored by their fine annotations. d, Bar plots showing CHI scores of Stromal cell embeddings across fine categories.", "contextualized_text": "Harnessing the power of single-cell large language models with parameter-efficient fine-tuning using scPEFT\nSupplementary Figures\nSupplementary  Figure  23:  Comparison  of  two  selected  cell  embeddings  from  native, finetuned scGPT, and scPEFT on the lung cancer atlas. a, Top: UMAP of all cells highlighting the Endothelial cell population. Bottom: zoomed-in UMAPs of Endothelial cell embeddings from native scGPT, finetuned scGPT, and scPEFT, respectively, colored by their fine-grained cell type annotations. b, Bar  plots  showing  CHI  scores  of  Endothelial  cell  embeddings  across  fine categories from the three models. c, UMAP visualizations of Stromal cell embeddings from native scGPT, finetuned scGPT, and scPEFT, respectively, colored by their fine annotations. d, Bar plots showing CHI scores of Stromal cell embeddings across fine categories.", "headings": ["Harnessing the power of single-cell large language models with parameter-efficient fine-tuning using scPEFT", "Supplementary Figures"], "pages": [54], "meta": {"schema_name": "docling_core.tra