./data/docling_include_no_vlm_2026-07-09/markdown/full_2026_07_06_rec_001358.md:497:finetuned scGPT, and scPEFT, respectively, colored by their fine-grained cell type annotations. b, Bar  plots  showing  CHI  scores  of  T  cell  embeddings  across  fine  categories  from  the  three models. c, UMAP visualizations of macrophage/monocyte cell embeddings from native scGPT, finetuned  scGPT,  and  scPEFT,  respectively,  colored  by  their  fine  annotations. d, Bar  plots showing CHI scores of macrophage/monocyte cell embeddings across fine categories. e, UMAP visualizations of cDC embeddings from each model, colored by their fine annotations. f, Bar plots showing CHI scores of cDC cell embeddings across fine categories.
