al gene expression prediction\""},{"record_id":"rec_000256","paper_type":"benchmark_resource","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"benchmark_resource","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract centers on benchmarking 79 large language models across 1130 transcriptomics datasets and releasing a platform. This is primarily a benchmark/resource and application platform paper, not a new candidate model.","evidence_snippet":"\"systematically benchmarked 79 large language models\" and \"developed AICellType ... a free, open-source R package and web platform\""}]}
