iptomics datasets and releasing AICellType as a platform, so this is a benchmark/resource paper rather than a candidate model. The biological text-to-cell annotation bridge is present, but the paper is not a new generative foundation model.","evidence_snippet":"\"systematically benchmarked 79 large language models\" and \"developed AICellType ... a free, open-source R package and web platform\""}]}
