./data/docling_include_no_vlm_2026-07-09/documents/full_2026_07_06_rec_003206.docling.json:2172:      "orig": "Prompt fine-tuning Since the introduction of GPT-2 [26], prompting has become a common method to elicit meaningful behavior from large language models ([27], [28], [29]). Recently, publicly available datasets like Alpaca [30] and dataset generators such as Flan [31], [32], [33] together with parameter efficient fine-tuning [34] have made it possible to train custom large language models. A survey of methods can be found in [35].",
./data/docling_include_no_vlm_2026-07-09/documents/full_2026_07_06_rec_003206.docling.json:2173:      "text": "Prompt fine-tuning Since the introduction of GPT-2 [26], prompting has become a common method to elicit meaningful behavior from large language models ([27], [28], [29]). Recently, publicly available datasets like Alpaca [30] and dataset generators such as Flan [31], [32], [33] together with parameter efficient fine-tuning [34] have made it possible to train custom large language models. A survey of methods can be found in [35]."
